# Transient lint fixtures. The boundary, wiring and anti-slop suites write these
# into a real project path to prove one override glob, then delete them, while
# other projects' lint targets scan the same tree. A scan that lists a fixture
# and opens it after the suite removed it fails with a bare ENOENT
# (genie-ops-center-v2-64a is the typecheck face of the same race; the root
# tsconfig excludes these prefixes for it).
#
# The harness lints an explicit fixture path with --no-ignore, so the fixtures
# themselves are still checked by the rules they exist to prove.
**/__boundary__*
**/__wiring__*
**/__antislop__*
